  "slug": "incoming-material-training-sign-off-form",
  "title": "Incoming Material Training Sign-Off Form",
  "subtitle": "Assign the incoming material curriculum, teach controlled references, observe task performance, remediate gaps, define authorization limits, and update qualification.",
  "description": "A competency-based incoming material training sign-off form that records more than attendance by connecting instruction for the supplier receipt inspection to observed demonstrations, explicit criteria, coaching, reassessment, authorization boundaries, and recurring review.",
  "use_case": "Use before a learner independently performs the supplier receipt inspection or after a procedure change, transfer, lapse, or performance gap requires documented evaluation and role-specific sign-off.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
